      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ENTERPRISE CHANNELS\n\nEmployees and reviewers\nInternal application APIs\nEvent streams\nSFTP / managed transfer\nShared mailboxes\nBatch Blob drops\n\nPRIVATE ZERO-TRUST INGRESS\n\nCanada Life private network\nInternal Application Gateway\nInternal API Management Premium\nOAuth2 / mTLS / quotas\nMicrosoft Entra ID\nSSO, MFA, Conditional Access, PIM",
      "originalText": "ENTERPRISE CHANNELS\n\nEmployees and reviewers\nInternal application APIs\nEvent streams\nSFTP / managed transfer\nShared mailboxes\nBatch Blob drops\n\nPRIVATE ZERO-TRUST INGRESS\n\nCanada Life private network\nInternal Application Gateway\nInternal API Management Premium\nOAuth2 / mTLS / quotas\nMicrosoft Entra ID\nSSO, MFA, Conditional Access, PIM",
      "fontSize": 19,
