      "versionNonce": 106,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789084000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PRIMARY REGION \u2014 CANADA EAST\nPrivate hub-spoke VNet | Azure Firewall | Private DNS | Private Endpoints\n\nPRIVATE AKS PLATFORM\nNext.js enterprise console \u2022 FastAPI control plane \u2022 elastic document workers\nconnector services \u2022 native line-of-business review queues \u2022 model promotion controller\n\nDATA AND MESSAGING\nBlob Storage: quarantine \u2192 clean \u2192 evidence; source documents retained 90 days\nService Bus Premium: intake, work, priority, retry, DLQ and output topics\nMongoDB Atlas: tenant, process, job, extraction and review metadata\nEvent Grid: lifecycle and integration events\n\nAI PROCESSING\nAzure AI Content Understanding: routing and custom analyzers\nManaged identity + private endpoint + customer-managed key where supported\nProduction launch gate: Canadian regional availability\n\nOUTPUTS\nSynchronous APIs \u2022 Service Bus topics \u2022 Event Grid events \u2022 governed batch files",
      "originalText": "PRIMARY REGION \u2014 CANADA EAST\nPrivate hub-spoke VNet | Azure Firewall | Private DNS | Private Endpoints\n\nPRIVATE AKS PLATFORM\nNext.js enterprise console \u2022 FastAPI control plane \u2022 elastic document workers\nconnector services \u2022 native line-of-business review queues \u2022 model promotion controller\n\nDATA AND MESSAGING\nBlob Storage: quarantine \u2192 clean \u2192 evidence; source documents retained 90 days\nService Bus Premium: intake, work, priority, retry, DLQ and output topics\nMongoDB Atlas: tenant, process, job, extraction and review metadata\nEvent Grid: lifecycle and integration events\n\nAI PROCESSING\nAzure AI Content Understanding: routing and custom analyzers\nManaged identity + private endpoint + customer-managed key where supported\nProduction launch gate: Canadian regional availability\n\nOUTPUTS\nSynchronous APIs \u2022 Service Bus topics \u2022 Event Grid events \u2022 governed batch files",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": true
    },
