      "updated": 1789084000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WARM DR \u2014 CANADA CENTRAL\n\nScaled-down private AKS\nPre-provisioned network and APIM\nACR geo-replica\nAtlas multi-region replica set\nBlob geo-replication\nService Bus recovery\nKey Vault and CMK recovery\nRegional monitoring\n\nFAILOVER RUNBOOK\n1. Declare incident\n2. Promote regional data services\n3. Scale AKS API and workers\n4. Shift private DNS and routes\n5. Validate identity and integrations\n6. Reconcile queued work\n\nQuarterly failover exercise\nAnnual business continuity test",
      "originalText": "WARM DR \u2014 CANADA CENTRAL\n\nScaled-down private AKS\nPre-provisioned network and APIM\nACR geo-replica\nAtlas multi-region replica set\nBlob geo-replication\nService Bus recovery\nKey Vault and CMK recovery\nRegional monitoring\n\nFAILOVER RUNBOOK\n1. Declare incident\n2. Promote regional data services\n3. Scale AKS API and workers\n4. Shift private DNS and routes\n5. Validate identity and integrations\n6. Reconcile queued work\n\nQuarterly failover exercise\nAnnual business continuity test",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.32,
      "autoResize": true
