      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ENTERPRISE GUARDRAILS\nSeparate subscriptions: Connectivity | Security/Management | Production | Non-production     \u2022 Azure Policy + Defender for Cloud\nKey Vault Premium / HSM-backed CMKs for document and data stores     \u2022 Azure Monitor, Application Insights, Log Analytics and Sentinel\nImmutable Blob WORM audit: 7 years     \u2022 GitHub Actions + ACR + signed images + Bicep     \u2022 Business-unit RBAC, quotas, partitioning and chargeback",
      "originalText": "ENTERPRISE GUARDRAILS\nSeparate subscriptions: Connectivity | Security/Management | Production | Non-production     \u2022 Azure Policy + Defender for Cloud\nKey Vault Premium / HSM-backed CMKs for document and data stores     \u2022 Azure Monitor, Application Insights, Log Analytics and Sentinel\nImmutable Blob WORM audit: 7 years     \u2022 GitHub Actions + ACR + signed images + Bicep     \u2022 Business-unit RBAC, quotas, partitioning and chargeback",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "autoResize": true
