      "updated": 1789084000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IDENTITY AND PRIVATE INGRESS\n\nEntra ID + MFA + Conditional Access\nPIM, access reviews and separation of duties\nManaged identities and workload identity federation\n\nExplicit roles\nPlatform operator\nSecurity auditor\nModel builder / approver\nProcess owner\nReviewer / adjudicator\nIntegration service\nRead-only auditor\n\nInternal Application Gateway\nInternal APIM OAuth2 / mTLS / rate limits\nBusiness-unit tenant context required",
      "originalText": "IDENTITY AND PRIVATE INGRESS\n\nEntra ID + MFA + Conditional Access\nPIM, access reviews and separation of duties\nManaged identities and workload identity federation\n\nExplicit roles\nPlatform operator\nSecurity auditor\nModel builder / approver\nProcess owner\nReviewer / adjudicator\nIntegration service\nRead-only auditor\n\nInternal Application Gateway\nInternal APIM OAuth2 / mTLS / rate limits\nBusiness-unit tenant context required",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.32,
