      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789084000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "QUARANTINE AND PRIVATE WORKLOAD ZONE\n\nNo document reaches processing before release:\n1. Extension, MIME, size and page validation\n2. Write-once quarantine Blob\n3. Defender malware scan\n4. DLP and data classification policy\n5. Reject, isolate or release clean object\n\nPrivate AKS controls\nPrivate API server and internal ingress\nSeparate API, worker and connector node pools\nEntra RBAC + Kubernetes network policies\nPod security and signed-image admission policy\nRestricted egress through Azure Firewall\nSecrets delivered from Key Vault CSI\n\nEvery request, queue message and storage operation carries tenant + process context.",
      "originalText": "QUARANTINE AND PRIVATE WORKLOAD ZONE\n\nNo document reaches processing before release:\n1. Extension, MIME, size and page validation\n2. Write-once quarantine Blob\n3. Defender malware scan\n4. DLP and data classification policy\n5. Reject, isolate or release clean object\n\nPrivate AKS controls\nPrivate API server and internal ingress\nSeparate API, worker and connector node pools\nEntra RBAC + Kubernetes network policies\nPod security and signed-image admission policy\nRestricted egress through Azure Firewall\nSecrets delivered from Key Vault CSI\n\nEvery request, queue message and storage operation carries tenant + process context.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": true
    },
