      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789084000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PRIVATE DATA, AI AND EVIDENCE ZONE\n\nPrivate Endpoints only; public access disabled\nPrivate DNS; TLS in transit; deny-by-default firewalls\n\nBlob Storage\nBusiness-unit/process prefixes and scoped identities\n90-day source retention; legal hold overrides deletion\n\nMongoDB Atlas\nBusiness-unit collection scoping and mandatory authorization filter\nExtraction/review records retained 7 years\nVersion-field concurrency, change history and soft-delete workflow\n\nContent Understanding\nanalyzeBinary from clean object bytes\nseparate dev/test/prod analyzer resources\nmanaged identity and least-privilege RBAC\nCanadian availability is a production gate\n\nImmutable Blob WORM\nSecurity, admin, model promotion and reviewer-decision evidence retained 7 years",
      "originalText": "PRIVATE DATA, AI AND EVIDENCE ZONE\n\nPrivate Endpoints only; public access disabled\nPrivate DNS; TLS in transit; deny-by-default firewalls\n\nBlob Storage\nBusiness-unit/process prefixes and scoped identities\n90-day source retention; legal hold overrides deletion\n\nMongoDB Atlas\nBusiness-unit collection scoping and mandatory authorization filter\nExtraction/review records retained 7 years\nVersion-field concurrency, change history and soft-delete workflow\n\nContent Understanding\nanalyzeBinary from clean object bytes\nseparate dev/test/prod analyzer resources\nmanaged identity and least-privilege RBAC\nCanadian availability is a production gate\n\nImmutable Blob WORM\nSecurity, admin, model promotion and reviewer-decision evidence retained 7 years",
