      "text": "DETECTION, RESPONSE AND PRIVACY\nAzure Monitor + Application Insights + Log Analytics \u2192 Microsoft Sentinel / SOC     \u2022 Defender for Cloud and Defender for Storage\nNo document content or extracted values in logs     \u2022 Correlation IDs, field names, confidence, status and actor IDs only     \u2022 CMK for document/data stores; platform-managed keys elsewhere",
      "originalText": "DETECTION, RESPONSE AND PRIVACY\nAzure Monitor + Application Insights + Log Analytics \u2192 Microsoft Sentinel / SOC     \u2022 Defender for Cloud and Defender for Storage\nNo document content or extracted values in logs     \u2022 Correlation IDs, field names, confidence, status and actor IDs only     \u2022 CMK for document/data stores; platform-managed keys elsewhere",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
