      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789084853271,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "7  DELIVER\nPublish canonical validated result by:\n\u2022 synchronous API\n\u2022 Service Bus topic\n\u2022 Event Grid event\n\u2022 governed batch file\nCapture downstream acknowledgement and reconcile failures\n\nEVERY STEP IS AUDITABLE\nCorrelation ID + tenant + process + model + policy + actor + time\nOperational state in MongoDB Atlas\nSource and evidence in Blob Storage\nSecurity/admin/model/review evidence in immutable Blob WORM\nTelemetry in Azure Monitor and Sentinel\n\nDELIVERY SEMANTICS\nAt-least-once messaging\nIdempotent consumers\nReplay by correlation ID\nBack-pressure protects AI and downstream systems",
      "originalText": "7  DELIVER\nPublish canonical validated result by:\n\u2022 synchronous API\n\u2022 Service Bus topic\n\u2022 Event Grid event\n\u2022 governed batch file\nCapture downstream acknowledgement and reconcile failures\n\nEVERY STEP IS AUDITABLE\nCorrelation ID + tenant + process + model + policy + actor + time\nOperational state in MongoDB Atlas\nSource and evidence in Blob Storage\nSecurity/admin/model/review evidence in immutable Blob WORM\nTelemetry in Azure Monitor and Sentinel\n\nDELIVERY SEMANTICS\nAt-least-once messaging\nIdempotent consumers\nReplay by correlation ID\nBack-pressure protects AI and downstream systems",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
