      "seed": 34,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 915165678,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789084853271,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CENTRAL IT PLATFORM TEAM\n\nOwns landing zones, networking, platform roadmap, SRE, incident management, security patching, connector catalogue, APIs and SLOs.\n\nDelegates by business unit:\nprocess ownership\nmodel building\nreview queues\nquota consumption\ndata classification and retention\n\nShowback / chargeback by tenant, pages, model and environment.\n\nRunbooks, service catalogue, support tiers and change windows are platform products.",
      "originalText": "CENTRAL IT PLATFORM TEAM\n\nOwns landing zones, networking, platform roadmap, SRE, incident management, security patching, connector catalogue, APIs and SLOs.\n\nDelegates by business unit:\nprocess ownership\nmodel building\nreview queues\nquota consumption\ndata classification and retention\n\nShowback / chargeback by tenant, pages, model and environment.\n\nRunbooks, service catalogue, support tiers and change windows are platform products.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
