      "versionNonce": 23025487,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789084853271,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RELIABILITY ENGINEERING\n\nWithin region\nAvailability Zones\nPod disruption budgets\nHPA + cluster autoscaler\nZone-redundant PaaS\nQueue back-pressure\nCircuit breakers and bulkheads\n\nRegional DR\nCanada Central warm standby\nRTO 4 hours\nRPO 15 minutes\nQuarterly failover exercise\nAnnual full continuity test\n\nBackups are isolated, encrypted, immutable and restore-tested.",
      "originalText": "RELIABILITY ENGINEERING\n\nWithin region\nAvailability Zones\nPod disruption budgets\nHPA + cluster autoscaler\nZone-redundant PaaS\nQueue back-pressure\nCircuit breakers and bulkheads\n\nRegional DR\nCanada Central warm standby\nRTO 4 hours\nRPO 15 minutes\nQuarterly failover exercise\nAnnual full continuity test\n\nBackups are isolated, encrypted, immutable and restore-tested.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
