    },
    {
      "id": "f4dt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2965,
      "y": 1235,
      "width": 265,
      "height": 510,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#004578",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "f4",
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 40,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1898930624,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789084853271,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SIZING ASSUMPTIONS \u2014 VALIDATE\n\nNo volume target supplied.\n\nDesign uses elastic workers driven by queue depth, oldest-message age and AI quotas.\n\nSeparate interactive and batch priorities.\n\nPer-business-unit quotas and budget alerts.\n\nBack-pressure protects AI and downstream systems.\n\nLoad test with real page mix and peak arrival profile.\n\nReserve DR capacity.\n\nPlanning SLO: 99.95%, excluding declared AI service constraints.",
      "originalText": "SIZING ASSUMPTIONS \u2014 VALIDATE\n\nNo volume target supplied.\n\nDesign uses elastic workers driven by queue depth, oldest-message age and AI quotas.\n\nSeparate interactive and batch priorities.\n\nPer-business-unit quotas and budget alerts.\n\nBack-pressure protects AI and downstream systems.\n\nLoad test with real page mix and peak arrival profile.\n\nReserve DR capacity.\n\nPlanning SLO: 99.95%, excluding declared AI service constraints.",
