      "updated": 1789084000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KEY DECISIONS\n1. One shared platform, isolated logically by business unit; authorization, partition keys, storage paths, quotas and chargeback use the same tenant ID.\n2. Asynchronous document processing is the default; Service Bus absorbs bursts and independently scalable workers protect the API tier.\n3. Human review is a first-class capability with LOB queues, skill/SLA routing and immutable reviewer attribution.\n4. Persistent business data stays in Canadian regions. Production use of Content Understanding is gated on Canadian regional availability.\n5. Production, non-production, connectivity and security/management are separated into enterprise subscriptions.",
      "originalText": "KEY DECISIONS\n1. One shared platform, isolated logically by business unit; authorization, partition keys, storage paths, quotas and chargeback use the same tenant ID.\n2. Asynchronous document processing is the default; Service Bus absorbs bursts and independently scalable workers protect the API tier.\n3. Human review is a first-class capability with LOB queues, skill/SLA routing and immutable reviewer attribution.\n4. Persistent business data stays in Canadian regions. Production use of Content Understanding is gated on Canadian regional availability.\n5. Production, non-production, connectivity and security/management are separated into enterprise subscriptions.",
